1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
AI agents are everywhere. Building a good one still takes days.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Every agent runs the same loop: reason, act, observe, decide.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Pick a proven technique, like ReAct, RAG, tree of thought or a team of agents. Tune each move.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,000
It works with any model: OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, Groq, or one running on your own machine.

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:57,000
You get real Python or TypeScript, with limits, retries and a built-in checkup.

6
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Run it. Here is a live weather agent built in minutes.

7
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Loopsmith. Free, open source, and it runs in your browser.
